<graph edgedefault="undirected"><node id="Nothing X app">
  <data key="d0">Nothing X app</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Nothing X app is a comprehensive companion application designed for managing and customizing the functionalities and settings of Nothing's audio devices, including the CMF Buds Pro 2, Ear (1), Ear (a), Neckband Pro, and Ear (stick). Users can customize a variety of settings through the app, such as audio equalizers, noise cancellation modes, sound profiles, gesture controls, and device-specific functionalities like Smart Dial functions. The application enhances user experience by allowing access to additional features, including firmware updates and Bluetooth connectivity management. 

Available on both the Google Play Store and iOS App Store, the Nothing X app facilitates seamless synchronization and control across compatible devices. It serves as an essential tool for users looking to optimize their audio device settings, check for updates, and enjoy enhanced audio performance through customizable features such as Active Noise Cancellation and various sound effects. The app’s design and functionality aim to improve the overall user experience with Nothing's audio products.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f8202293fdace1a3a66be97a3995370&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b23107caad65d85305805a37ddbe28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242b40fbdd789fce17cd5d53222cb91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e7514c9c486c31232321ac43b9689ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbad053247bfe41ce192c651034259c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea3750d302ca3a5f45590d544e79cdaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8564fc99ee9391246494d993bc4be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79d8dc4ced2f49b73dd01d066a09896&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1bc8f3ce2d2c5d835ffeade41737ee5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443862ed6a46e95ac18dbc4e38f2090&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-136bde614c09969c0d7fb82cc253fd47</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612037</data>
</node>
<node id="Nothing Ear">
  <data key="d0">Nothing Ear</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nothing Ear is a line of wireless earbuds produced by Nothing Technology, recognized for their advanced features such as Environmental Noise Cancellation (ENC), Active Noise Cancellation, customizable sound profiles, and Dual Connection support. These earbuds are specifically designed to work seamlessly with the Nothing Phone, enhancing the audio experience through advanced connectivity features and easy setup facilitated by the Fast Pair functionality. The Nothing Ear series utilizes Bluetooth technology for audio playback and can be paired with the Nothing Phone via the Nothing X app, ensuring a user-friendly experience. Overall, Nothing Ear represents a thoughtfully designed range of wireless earbuds aimed at providing high-quality audio and convenient connectivity for users of the Nothing Phone.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6b8eb92f55e1f3c041c691be7b6dbda7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-124df9689f92596c4fbc5e0e680893f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9fb365d0322c82fb6ff52dc4a7925f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b1d82ee9e80b9a4011cc5dfdad909fc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612042</data>
</node>
<node id="iOS Device">
  <data key="d0">iOS Device</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">iOS Device includes any device running Apple's iOS, allowing for Bluetooth connectivity with the Nothing X app.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422</data>
