  <data key="d5">1767612042</data>
</node>
<node id="Android Device">
  <data key="d0">Android Device</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">An Android Device is a mobile device running the Android operating system, capable of various functionalities including app installation and location services.&lt;SEP&gt;Android Device encompasses devices using the Android operating system, compatible with the Nothing X app for managing earbuds.&lt;SEP&gt;Android Device refers to smartphones or tablets that operate using the Android operating system developed by Google.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5c73879f5f4d2c0285aa18473f689789&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612042</data>
</node>
<node id="CMF Watch app">
  <data key="d0">CMF Watch app</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CMF Watch app is a mobile application designed to connect with the CMF Watch Pro and Watch Pro 2 smartwatches, enabling users to manage settings, sync data, and enhance the functionality of their devices. It facilitates notifications and various features between the smartwatch and a phone, and it is essential to configure the app correctly for optimal performance.

This companion application allows users to customize their watches, manage fitness tracking, and control music playback. Additionally, the CMF Watch app provides options for upgrading firmware and adjusting watch settings for improved operation. It is specifically tailored for managing health metrics and features, offering a comprehensive suite of functionalities that enhance the overall user experience.

While the app is designed to work seamlessly with the CMF Watch products, users may encounter connectivity issues, particularly with Android devices. Nevertheless, the CMF Watch app remains an essential tool for optimizing the user's engagement with the Watch Pro series, providing extensive customization, health data management, and access to additional features.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f73d28d893bcd51ecb5c4b3b1f54870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f6c1381dcd623ad5b2ea0b60f6ad95d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d88ccae3cdc762688c1e8d90c4e68c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128e66067604ae44825d98ba3ed45122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf93869f27e0db181fc1e8abda02b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612046</data>
</node>
