<node id="iPhone">
  <data key="d0">iPhone</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The iPhone is a line of smartphones developed and marketed by Apple Inc., known for its advanced technology, user-friendly interface, and the iOS operating system. These devices offer a variety of features, including app downloading, messaging, and data transfer capabilities, making them capable of managing wireless connections effectively. The iPhone is also designed to support the Nothing X app and Nothing Ear for enhanced audio features and connectivity. Users are instructed on how to prepare their iPhones for data transfer to the Nothing Phone, demonstrating the device's versatility and integration with other technologies. Overall, the iPhone is recognized for its high-quality build and advanced functionalities, maintaining its status as a leading smartphone in the market.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ff9ab0e6b0a19cc3df9b2e42e60f607f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6165e1e8378c1118b98626013d6262b7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abefe8b5c23aeae06eaa603651797d38&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a4e6bb17059b6ce78b33dddb496db9d2</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
