<node id="Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE)">
  <data key="d0">Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bluetooth Low Energy (BLE) is a wireless personal area network technology designed for short-range communication, commonly used in earbuds for efficient power consumption.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-762fda66ccc0b9dd4cae96c4b09a2422</data>
