<node id="memory management mechanisms">
  <data key="d0">memory management mechanisms</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Memory management mechanisms refer to processes and features on Android devices that manage background applications and system resources, impacting app connectivity.</data>
