<node id="CMF Watch">
  <data key="d0">CMF Watch</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CMF Watch is an application that users interact with on Android devices for various functionalities, such as managing tasks and app performance.&lt;SEP&gt;The CMF Watch is an organization that develops and supports the Watch Pro along with its related applications for various operating systems.</data>
