<node id="Voice Messages">
  <data key="d0">Voice Messages</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Voice Messages are audio messages sent via apps that may encounter issues in sending or receiving due to various factors.&lt;SEP&gt;Voice Messages are audio recordings sent through apps, often requiring microphone access for functionality.</data>
