<node id="Data Network">
  <data key="d0">Data Network</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A Data Network refers to the infrastructure that enables data transmission across devices, essential for services like VoLTE and MMS.&lt;SEP&gt;Data Network refers to the cellular or Wi-Fi connection that apps need to function properly and access the internet.</data>
