<node id="Internet Connection">
  <data key="d0">Internet Connection</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Internet Connection is essential for apps to communicate with online services and may impact their functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Internet Connection refers to the ability of a smartphone to access online services and functionalities.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-281d19d9c4f252fd5c844c3d467ca398&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06e37afdf610d89a09df8901349a725e</data>
