<node id="App Info">
  <data key="d0">App Info</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">App Info is a section within device settings where users can view and modify permissions and data usage of individual applications.&lt;SEP&gt;App Info pertains to settings related to application management on mobile devices, including permissions and storage.</data>
