<node id="Nothing X App">
  <data key="d0">Nothing X App</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The Nothing X App is a comprehensive mobile application developed by Nothing Phone, designed to enhance user experience through a variety of features for managing and customizing Nothing-branded audio devices. It provides users with options for sound customization, including equalizer settings and the ability to adjust audio profiles such as the Ultra Bass feature.

The app specifically supports the configuration and personalization of several Nothing audio products, including the Ear (2) and Ear (a) earbuds, as well as the Buds, Buds Pro, and Neckband Pro. Users can control functionalities such as noise cancellation, device pairing, sound profiles, gestures, and connection settings, thereby allowing for a tailored listening experience. 

Additionally, the Nothing X App facilitates the management and connecting of devices, ensuring seamless operation and updates for compatible Bluetooth devices. Available for download on both Android and iOS platforms, the app aims to enhance the usability of Nothing's audio offerings by providing intuitive control and customization options, including for products like the CMF Buds 2 and Buds Pro Earbuds. Overall, the Nothing X App serves as a vital software platform for maximizing the performance and personalization of Nothing's audio devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8e8ce97e9623a3206989beb9bb64519&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6a5e79a49bc7db2a612f28136aee41c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93607977c7e870361284500bad913d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9c603ca72c28f9a9a34c1ddfef9b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebeef135007ca56eca4d845a2c04e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7729ae6048c026d1b7b5e466d0f1c36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c721c853ee8f8f0dc302ae4d23208b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbdc3aa884ec77acb84402d00879691d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cde718609da4920ebfa164616b8d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4524a05ac17de1be9923e9a9dc9c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-946e2c39d383e3255fe1b3a1508733e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-310bcdfd35de1b898e48e8659f40d35e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5712d3b2c04697652ebea3ad203a5e64</data>
