<node id="Earbuds">
  <data key="d0">Earbuds</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Earbuds are compact audio devices worn in the ear, often connected wirelessly to playback sound from various media sources.&lt;SEP&gt;Earbuds are wireless audio devices that connect via Bluetooth, providing sound output for various applications.&lt;SEP&gt;Earbuds are wireless audio devices that may encounter charging problems, requiring specific conditions for optimal charging.</data>
