<node id="Microphone">
  <data key="d0">Microphone</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Microphone is a hardware component that captures audio input, necessary for functionalities like voice messaging in applications.&lt;SEP&gt;The Neckband Pro is equipped with a built-in microphone that utilizes Environmental Noise Cancellation for clear audio during phone calls.</data>
