<node id="CMF Buds Pro 2">
  <data key="d0">CMF Buds Pro 2</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The CMF Buds Pro 2 are sophisticated wireless earbuds developed by Nothing, designed to enhance the listening experience with a variety of advanced features. They offer multi-device connectivity and Bluetooth pairing for user convenience, allowing seamless transitions between devices. The earbuds support spatial audio effects, making them ideal for immersive audio experiences.

Additional features include gesture controls, which enable users to manage playback easily, and dual connection capabilities for linking with two devices simultaneously. The CMF Buds Pro 2 also prioritize sound quality with high-definition audio support via LDAC, alongside customizable sound settings through the Nothing X app, which allows for personalized audio adjustments.

The model is equipped with Smart Active Noise Cancellation (ANC), effectively minimizing ambient noise for focused listening. Moreover, users can fine-tune their audio experience with customizable EQ settings. The earbuds are designed to be water-resistant, ensuring durability during various activities.

Overall, the CMF Buds Pro 2 are positioned as high-quality earphones that cater to audiophiles and casual listeners alike, providing a range of functionalities for an enhanced and tailored audio experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8564fc99ee9391246494d993bc4be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b23107caad65d85305805a37ddbe28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242b40fbdd789fce17cd5d53222cb91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-310bcdfd35de1b898e48e8659f40d35e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5712d3b2c04697652ebea3ad203a5e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612081</data>
</node>
<node id="AAC Mode">
  <data key="d0">AAC Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">AAC Mode is a setting that allows users to improve audio quality and reduce power consumption when using earphones.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-5712d3b2c04697652ebea3ad203a5e64</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612081</data>
</node>
<node id="Bluetooth">
  <data key="d0">Bluetooth</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bluetooth is a versatile wireless technology standard that facilitates short-range communication between various devices, including smartphones, laptops, and audio devices. It enables seamless connections for tasks such as data syncing and notification management. Specifically, it allows devices like the Watch Pro to connect with iOS phones, CMF Watch app, and other accessories like CMF Earbuds and Ear (1) earbuds. This technology is essential for pairing processes and is utilized to enhance user experience through functionalities such as syncing data and notifications across devices. Bluetooth's wide range of applications underscores its significance in modern connectivity, proving to be crucial for connecting smartwatches, headphones, and other gadgets efficiently over short distances.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7729ae6048c026d1b7b5e466d0f1c36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-01cde718609da4920ebfa164616b8d87&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5712d3b2c04697652ebea3ad203a5e64&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a93494f099711f42904d9b1378c73449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-136bde614c09969c0d7fb82cc253fd47</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612087</data>
</node>
