<node id="Firmware">
  <data key="d0">Firmware</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Firmware is the permanent software programmed into a device that controls its hardware and functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware is the permanent software programmed into a hardware device that controls its functions and features, requiring updates for optimization.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware refers to the software programmed into the Watch Pro that controls its hardware and provides functionality, which can be updated.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware refers to the software that is embedded in the hardware of a device, which can be updated for improved functionality.&lt;SEP&gt;Firmware refers to the software updates available for the Nothing Phone, ensuring the device runs smoothly and securely.</data>
