<node id="Ear (2)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (2)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (2) is a model of wireless earbuds designed to connect with devices via Bluetooth.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (2) is a model of wireless earbuds that features advanced touch controls, enhanced connectivity options, and Active Noise Cancellation.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (2) is a pair of wireless earbuds that supports various audio functions, including dual connection with multiple Bluetooth devices and customizable gesture controls.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (2) is a wireless earbud model that features Bluetooth connectivity, Active Noise Cancellation, and customizable audio settings through the Nothing X app.&lt;SEP&gt;The Ear (2) is an updated model of wireless earbuds that includes features for enhanced sound control and compatibility with various apps.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-efdc5389f3967066ca146a24ea33b83a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9c603ca72c28f9a9a34c1ddfef9b9c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e7514c9c486c31232321ac43b9689ae</data>
