<node id="Ear (a)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (a)</data>
  <data key="d1">product</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (a) is a product that features advanced audio technology, including noise cancellation, high-quality audio streaming, and customization options for an enhanced listening experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (a) is a wireless earbud product that offers features such as Active Noise Cancellation, Dual Connection, and customizable sound experiences.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (a) is another model of wireless earbuds that connects to devices using Bluetooth technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (a) refers to a model of wireless earbuds designed to work with the Nothing X App, featuring various touch controls and noise cancellation modes.</data>
