<node id="Ear (open)">
  <data key="d0">Ear (open)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Ear (open) is a model of Bluetooth wireless earbuds known for their exceptional sound performance and user customization options. Designed to connect seamlessly with multiple devices, these earbuds feature a range of innovative attributes, including gesture control functions and dual connection capabilities. They are specifically engineered for high-quality audio and sweat resistance. Additionally, Ear (open) incorporates advanced features such as Environmental Noise Cancellation and voice assistant integration, making them suitable for various listening environments. Positioned as a unique offering from Nothing, Ear (open) shares similarities with the CMF Buds Pro 2, yet differentiates itself with distinctive characteristics that enhance the user experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbdc3aa884ec77acb84402d00879691d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea4524a05ac17de1be9923e9a9dc9c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443862ed6a46e95ac18dbc4e38f2090</data>
