  <data key="d0">Functional Crown</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Functional Crown is a feature on the Watch Pro that is used for navigating menus, settings, and performing actions like restarting the device.&lt;SEP&gt;The Functional Crown is a feature of the Watch Pro that allows users to navigate the menu and access various functionalities.&lt;SEP&gt;The Functional Crown is a physical control feature on the Watch Pro, used to navigate settings and perform various actions on the device.</data>
