<node id="Firmware Upgrade">
  <data key="d0">Firmware Upgrade</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Firmware Upgrade refers to the process of updating the internal software of devices, such as the Watch Pro and Ear (1), to enhance their functionality, improve performance, and fix bugs or issues. It is specifically available through the CMF Watch app, which facilitates the firmware upgrade for the Watch Pro, enabling users to benefit from enhanced features and improved hardware control. This process is essential for maintaining optimal device performance and ensuring that the latest enhancements are applied to these devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7729ae6048c026d1b7b5e466d0f1c36c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-39d4901014b867cda8bfaf59458315b9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a</data>
