  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">CMF Earbuds are wireless earbuds designed for convenience and audio quality, with a charging case that requires proper maintenance to function effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;CMF Earbuds are wireless earbuds that support gesture controls and dual connections, allowing users to switch between devices seamlessly.&lt;SEP&gt;CMF Earbuds are wireless earbuds with advanced features such as dual connection capabilities and gesture controls for user convenience.&lt;SEP&gt;CMF Earbuds is a brand of earbuds designed for various audio functionalities, including support for online meetings and gesture controls for music.</data>
