  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Nothing X is an app that controls settings related to the Nothing phone's features, including voice AI integration.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing X is an application developed for wireless audio products, facilitating functions such as device control and customization for audio settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing X is the brand associated with a range of audio products, including the Ear (a) earbuds.&lt;SEP&gt;Nothing X is the mobile application designed to enhance user interaction with CMF earbuds, offering features like volume control and noise cancellation settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f522fc3ced3c136bbb28b287f215d20c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ea28975423f6227a8330d76c202878&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93607977c7e870361284500bad913d36</data>
