  <data key="d0">App Store</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The App Store is Apple's platform for downloading applications, including the Nothing X app for iOS devices.&lt;SEP&gt;The App Store is a digital distribution platform for applications, where users can download the Nothing X app for iOS devices.&lt;SEP&gt;The App Store is a digital distribution platform for iOS applications, where users can download the CMF Watch app.&lt;SEP&gt;The App Store is a digital marketplace for iOS devices where users can download applications, including the Nothing X App.&lt;SEP&gt;The App Store is an online marketplace for iOS apps where the Nothing X app can be downloaded.</data>
