<node id="Volume Control">
  <data key="d0">Volume Control</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Volume Control allows users to adjust the sound levels during playback, influencing user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Volume Control is a feature of the CMF earbuds that allows users to adjust sound levels through gestures or directly from their devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2ea28975423f6227a8330d76c202878</data>
