  <data key="d2">Power Supply provides the electrical energy required to charge devices such as laptops, earbuds, and others, usually via an adaptor.&lt;SEP&gt;Power Supply refers to the source used to recharge the Charging Case of the CMF earbuds, ensuring they are ready for use.</data>
