<node id="Google Play">
  <data key="d0">Google Play</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Play is a digital distribution service and online platform that allows users to download applications for Android devices. Among the applications available for download on this service is the Nothing X App. Google Play provides a convenient space for Android users to access various apps, including the Nothing X App, enhancing their mobile experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93607977c7e870361284500bad913d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ebeef135007ca56eca4d845a2c04e9d0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c</data>
