  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The iOS App Store is a digital distribution service for downloading the Nothing X app on iOS devices.&lt;SEP&gt;The iOS App Store is an application distribution platform for iOS devices, providing access to various apps, including the Nothing X app.&lt;SEP&gt;The iOS App Store is an online platform for downloading applications for iOS devices, including the Nothing X App.&lt;SEP&gt;The iOS App Store is an online platform where iPhone users can download applications, including the Nothing X App.&lt;SEP&gt;The iOS App Store is an online platform where users can download the Nothing X App for iOS devices.</data>
