<node id="LDAC">
  <data key="d0">LDAC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">LDAC is a high-definition audio codec developed by Sony, designed to enhance audio quality during Bluetooth streaming. It enables the transmission of high-resolution audio files, resulting in improved sound detail and quality, particularly when used with compatible devices such as the Ear (a) and CMF Buds Pro 2. LDAC provides superior audio performance, allowing users to enjoy high-definition audio across various wireless connections, provided that the devices support this codec.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8c10ba86f3c652add8c1d23db1a9625b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f8b23107caad65d85305805a37ddbe28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242b40fbdd789fce17cd5d53222cb91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ca8764057d5d820c4c3fb502a440d2f</data>
