  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Spatial Audio Effect enhances the listening experience by creating a three-dimensional sound environment for immersive audio.&lt;SEP&gt;The Spatial Audio Effect is a sound technology providing an immersive listening experience with 3D audio.</data>
