<node id="ANC (Active Noise Cancellation)">
  <data key="d0">ANC (Active Noise Cancellation)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">ANC is a feature of the Ear (a) earbuds that reduces external sounds by using active noise cancellation technology, reaching levels of up to 45 dB.&lt;SEP&gt;ANC is a feature that reduces ambient sounds, allowing listeners to have an uninterrupted audio experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a feature in Ear (2) that reduces ambient noise, enhancing audio experience during playback and calls.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-716596cbb2a7e8b3702d6ceb7f52724e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-310bcdfd35de1b898e48e8659f40d35e</data>
