<node id="Bluetooth 5.3">
  <data key="d0">Bluetooth 5.3</data>
  <data key="d1">technology</data>
  <data key="d2">Bluetooth 5.3 is the latest wireless communication protocol that facilitates connectivity among various devices. It is supported by a range of products, including the Watch Pro, which utilizes Bluetooth 5.3 for seamless connections. The protocol is also employed by the Ear (open) and Ear (a), enhancing their ability to connect to other devices while providing improved efficiency. Additionally, Bluetooth 5.3 is utilized in devices such as the Neckband Pro, Buds, Buds Pro, and Nothing Ear, all benefiting from its advanced connectivity capabilities. Furthermore, Bluetooth 5.3 is featured in the CMF Buds Pro 2, underscoring its widespread application across different audio devices, all of which aim to offer better connectivity and energy efficiency.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8464f2a22c355940190a72202a4bd5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3c721c853ee8f8f0dc302ae4d23208b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93607977c7e870361284500bad913d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-242b40fbdd789fce17cd5d53222cb91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-026c9aac607d8ab10d1f5ae9d51556e9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f443862ed6a46e95ac18dbc4e38f2090</data>
