<node id="Smart Dial">
  <data key="d0">Smart Dial</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Smart Dial is a feature on the CMF Buds Pro 2 charging case that allows users to customize various functions through the Nothing X app.&lt;SEP&gt;The Smart Dial is a feature on the charging case that allows users to control various functions of the earbuds through different types of button presses.&lt;SEP&gt;The Smart Dial is a multifunctional control feature on the Neckband Pro that allows users to adjust volume, switch modes, and control music playback.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-242b40fbdd789fce17cd5d53222cb91d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbad053247bfe41ce192c651034259c3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8564fc99ee9391246494d993bc4be4</data>
