<node id="Ultra Bass Technology">
  <data key="d0">Ultra Bass Technology</data>
  <data key="d1">feature</data>
  <data key="d2">Ultra Bass Technology enhances low-frequency audio experience in real-time, making music sound more dynamic and powerful.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultra Bass Technology enhances low-frequency signals in music for a more powerful bass experience.&lt;SEP&gt;Ultra Bass Technology is an audio processing feature in the Neckband Pro that dynamically enhances low-frequency sounds to provide improved bass performance.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3c721c853ee8f8f0dc302ae4d23208b8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93607977c7e870361284500bad913d36&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8564fc99ee9391246494d993bc4be4</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612157</data>
</node>
<node id="Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)">
  <data key="d0">Active Noise Cancellation (ANC)</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a cutting-edge technology employed in various earbuds including the Ear (1), CMF Buds Pro 2, and CMF Buds 2. This feature significantly reduces unwanted ambient sounds, leading to a superior listening experience by utilizing microphones and speakers to create sound waves that counteract background noise. In the Ear (1) earbuds, ANC enhances audio quality by effectively diminishing external noise, allowing for a more immersive auditory experience. Similarly, the CMF Buds Pro 2 integrates ANC to enhance listening by minimizing background distractions. Additionally, CMF Buds 2 also supports this technology, ensuring users benefit from a clearer sound environment. Overall, Active Noise Cancellation serves to enrich the listening experience across these devices by providing users with a more focused and enjoyable sound.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a8564fc99ee9391246494d993bc4be4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-56220d4c1145af0000fc9cb728dc6db7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbcfd0ba7e5f79063be82c76153444e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1e7514c9c486c31232321ac43b9689ae&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ecb83fc961a06d6a2e205ffa27cd9700</data>
