  <data key="d0">ANC</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">ANC stands for Active Noise Cancellation, a technology in Nothing Ear that reduces background noise during audio playback.&lt;SEP&gt;ANC stands for Active Noise Cancellation, which reduces background noise during audio playback and calls.&lt;SEP&gt;Active Noise Cancellation (ANC) is a feature in the Buds that reduces ambient noise for an improved listening experience.</data>
