  <data key="d2">IP54 Rating indicates that Ear (2) earbud is protected against dust and low-pressure water jets, ensuring limited exposure to elements.&lt;SEP&gt;IP54 indicates that the Buds are dustproof and water-resistant, offering a level of protection against dust and splashes.&lt;SEP&gt;IP54 rating indicates that Ear (open) has a certain level of water and dust resistance, making it suitable for various conditions.</data>
