  <data key="d2">The Neckband Pro is a product designed for audio playback, featuring advanced functionalities and specifications for optimal user experience.&lt;SEP&gt;The Neckband Pro is a set of earphones that offers dual connectivity with two devices and advanced control features for calls and music playback.&lt;SEP&gt;The Neckband Pro is a type of earphone that supports fast charging and has a long battery life, with capabilities to connect to two devices simultaneously.&lt;SEP&gt;The Neckband Pro is a wireless audio device known for its features like Active Noise Cancellation, Ultra Bass Technology, and multiple audio customization options.</data>
