<node id="Google Fast Pair">
  <data key="d0">Google Fast Pair</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Fast Pair is a feature supported by Ear (2) that facilitates quick and easy pairing with Android devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Fast Pair is a feature that enables quick and easy Bluetooth pairing for devices, enhancing user experience with compatible devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Fast Pair is a technology supported by Ear (open) to provide quick and easy pairing with compatible devices.</data>
