  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Microsoft Swift Pair is a feature supported by Ear (2), enabling swift connections with Windows devices for ease of use.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Swift Pair is a feature that Ear (open) supports, enabling seamless pairing with Windows devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Microsoft Swift Pair is a feature that facilitates seamless Bluetooth connections for compatible audio devices, improving connectivity for users.</data>
