<node id="Audio Formats">
  <data key="d0">Audio Formats</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Audio formats supported by the Neckband Pro include AAC and SBC, allowing for high-quality audio playback across compatible devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Ear (open) supports audio formats like AAC and SBC, ensuring compatibility with various devices for high-quality sound.</data>
