<node id="Sound Profiles">
  <data key="d0">Sound Profiles</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Neckband Pro includes various sound profiles such as Balanced, More Bass, More Treble, and Voice, allowing users to customize their listening experience.</data>
