<node id="Wireless Charging">
  <data key="d0">Wireless Charging</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Wireless Charging allows the Nothing Phone (1) to charge without a physical connection, utilizing compatible Qi chargers for convenience.&lt;SEP&gt;Wireless Charging is a feature supported by Nothing Phone (2) that allows charging without a physical connection using QI certified chargers.&lt;SEP&gt;Wireless charging is a method through which the Neckband Pro could be charged without direct cable connection, though it is specified that this feature is not supported.</data>
