<node id="Fast Charging">
  <data key="d0">Fast Charging</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Fast Charging is a feature of the Ear (a) that allows for quick charging capabilities, enabling users to use the earbuds shortly after charging.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast Charging is a feature that enables quicker charging speeds for the Ear (stick) case and earbuds, enhancing usability.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast Charging is a technology supported by Phone (2a) that allows the device to charge rapidly, enhancing usability for users.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast charging is a feature of Phone 1 that allows for quicker recharging of the battery compared to standard charging methods.&lt;SEP&gt;Fast charging refers to the rapid charging capability of the Neckband Pro, allowing for significant playback time with short charge periods.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-1bd5bdbf50fdf619063eece8e9e67241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27081652ef7a553b2a6096008ef80269&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f8202293fdace1a3a66be97a3995370&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cbeb4732200e7559b14badeb7c65f47c</data>
