  <data key="d0">Browser App</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Browser App provides internet browsing capabilities, including history management and privacy settings.&lt;SEP&gt;The Browser App is a software application that enables users to access and navigate the internet.&lt;SEP&gt;The Browser App is an application on the Nothing Phone used for web browsing, allowing users to clear history and manage privacy settings.</data>
