<node id="VoLTE">
  <data key="d0">VoLTE</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">VoLTE, or Voice Over LTE, is a telecommunications technology that facilitates high-speed wireless communication for mobile phones, enabling high-quality voice and video calls over 4G LTE networks. This technology enhances call quality and introduces additional features such as video calling, making it a significant advancement in mobile communication. By utilizing the LTE network, VoLTE allows for improved performance compared to traditional voice calling technologies, thereby enriching the user experience for both voice and video communications.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a9ca0a66c298c31fec04cbfc30d7b98c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb46e252d3a2a9cb08cfababdb615773&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e</data>
