<node id="User Icon">
  <data key="d0">User Icon</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The User Icon represents a feature on the device that allows users to access their personal account settings and information.&lt;SEP&gt;The user icon represents a feature in the lock screen settings that allows multiple users to have profiles on the device.</data>
