<node id="Power Button">
  <data key="d0">Power Button</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Power Button is a physical button on smartphones used to turn the device on or off.&lt;SEP&gt;The Power Button is a physical button on the device used to activate various functions, such as unlocking the device and launching the camera.&lt;SEP&gt;The power button is a physical control on the Nothing phone that allows users to turn the device on or off and is involved in troubleshooting.</data>
