  <data key="d5">1767612233</data>
</node>
<node id="Factory Defaults">
  <data key="d0">Factory Defaults</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Factory Defaults are the original settings and states of a device before any customization or user modifications have been made.&lt;SEP&gt;Factory Defaults is a category of settings on electronic devices that return all settings and data to their original state, erasing user data.&lt;SEP&gt;Factory Defaults refer to the original settings of the device, which can be restored to erase user data and settings.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e</data>
