<node id="Files App">
  <data key="d0">Files App</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Files App is an application on the device designed for file management, allowing users to clean up storage space and organize files.&lt;SEP&gt;The Files App is used to manage and organize files stored on the device, allowing users to clean up storage space and organize their data.&lt;SEP&gt;The Files App on Nothing Phone is used for managing and cleaning storage space by detecting temporary files and folders.&lt;SEP&gt;The Files app is a utility used to manage, organize, and delete files stored on the device, as well as accessing cloud storage.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e</data>
