<node id="GPS">
  <data key="d0">GPS</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">GPS, or Global Positioning System, is an advanced navigation system that utilizes satellite technology to accurately determine the precise geographical location of a device. This system is widely employed for various applications, including geotagging in photography and providing essential location services for navigation. GPS is notably integrated into devices such as smartwatches, exemplified by its support in Watch Pro, which enables users to track their location effectively during outdoor activities. Overall, GPS serves as a critical feature in both personal navigation and geographic positioning across multiple types of devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612237</data>
</node>
<node id="MMS">
  <data key="d0">MMS</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">MMS, or Multimedia Messaging Service, is a messaging protocol that enables users to send multimedia content, including images, videos, and audio, over mobile networks. It serves as an extension of the Short Message Service (SMS), allowing communication through multimedia rather than just text-based messages. Users can utilize MMS to share images and other media via their mobile devices, although the service may occasionally encounter issues, such as failure to download the multimedia files. Overall, MMS is designed to enhance the messaging capabilities on mobile networks by incorporating various forms of media.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7c7e41b65ef7bcc80c8f1decc9bf2928&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65f13477800edffaf85ef49b0eb80982&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2af070275f346cb3aabc6679c7791a2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-59d089d6dd16ac59cfa0d577b293a12e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3ce2dd4dcddbe486368b957aabc2e335</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612240</data>
</node>
