  <data key="d2">Phone 1 is a mobile phone model that supports various features such as video calling and battery management.&lt;SEP&gt;Phone 1 is a smartphone that features advanced capabilities such as dual SIM support, fast charging, and compatibility with various wireless technologies like WiFi 6.</data>
