<node id="Network Carrier">
  <data key="d0">Network Carrier</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">A Network Carrier is a telecommunications company providing mobile services, including voice and data connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;Network Carrier is a telecommunications company that provides mobile service, enabling VoLTE and video calling features through their network.&lt;SEP&gt;Network Carrier refers to the service provider that supplies network connectivity for the phone, necessary for VoLTE and video calling functionalities.</data>
