  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Lithium Battery is a rechargeable battery technology commonly used in mobile phones, known for its high energy density and longevity.&lt;SEP&gt;Lithium Battery is a type of rechargeable battery commonly used in smartphones and other portable electronic devices for its lightweight and high energy density.&lt;SEP&gt;Lithium Battery is the type of battery commonly used in smartphones, known for its efficiency and longevity when managed properly.</data>
