<node id="Battery Saver">
  <data key="d0">Battery Saver</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Battery Saver is a feature in mobile phones that helps extend battery life by restricting background processes and managing performance.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Saver is a feature in smartphones that helps conserve battery life by limiting background activity and adjusting performance settings.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Saver is a feature on smartphones that limits background processes to conserve battery life.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Saver is a feature on smartphones that manages energy consumption to prolong battery life.&lt;SEP&gt;Battery Saver is a feature that helps prolong battery life by limiting background processes when the battery is low.</data>
