<node id="WiFi Connection">
  <data key="d0">WiFi Connection</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">A WiFi Connection is necessary for setting up the Nothing Phone and transferring data efficiently during the initial setup.&lt;SEP&gt;A WiFi connection is a wireless networking technology that allows devices to connect to the internet and communicate with each other.&lt;SEP&gt;WiFi Connection provides an alternative to mobile data for internet access, which can alleviate data limitations.&lt;SEP&gt;WiFi Connection refers to a wireless networking technology that allows devices to connect to the Internet or communicate with one another.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-a4e6bb17059b6ce78b33dddb496db9d2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aecf49d9e86fc2b3fbfb0f065b82e03e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcacac32b6b6cffea40cb0a17d301d61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6165e1e8378c1118b98626013d6262b7</data>
