<node id="Game Mode">
  <data key="d0">Game Mode</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Game Mode is a built-in feature of the Nothing Phone that is specifically designed to enhance the gaming experience. It optimizes the device's performance by managing notifications, which reduces distractions during gameplay, and improves graphics, potentially leading to a more immersive experience. This feature functions to ensure that the Nothing Phone is tailored for gaming, enhancing both responsiveness and visual quality while gaming. Overall, Game Mode serves to provide users with a seamless and enjoyable gaming experience on their Nothing Phone.</data>
