<node id="Call Waiting">
  <data key="d0">Call Waiting</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Call Waiting is a feature on the Nothing Phone that allows users to be notified of incoming calls while they are already on another call.&lt;SEP&gt;Call Waiting is a feature that allows users to receive incoming calls while on another call, enhancing communication efficiency.&lt;SEP&gt;Call Waiting is a feature that allows users to receive incoming calls while on another call, managed within the phone's settings.</data>
