  <data key="d0">SIM Tray</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">SIM Tray is a part of the Nothing Phone where the SIM card is inserted, allowing it to connect to mobile networks.&lt;SEP&gt;The SIM Tray is a component in the Nothing Phone that holds the SIM card, allowing the device to connect to cellular networks.&lt;SEP&gt;The SIM Tray is a component of the Nothing Phone that houses the SIM card for cellular connectivity.&lt;SEP&gt;The SIM Tray is a component of the Nothing Phone where the SIM card is inserted, allowing the device to connect to mobile networks.</data>
