<node id="Google Photos">
  <data key="d0">Google Photos</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google Photos is a cloud-based service integrated with the Nothing Phone, used for storing and organizing photos, including screen recordings.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Photos is a cloud-based service used for storing and managing photos and videos, accessible from the Nothing Phone.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Photos is a photo management and sharing service that synchronizes images across devices and backups.&lt;SEP&gt;Google Photos is the cloud-based service where users can store, share, and back up images and videos taken on the Nothing Phone.</data>
