<node id="SIM Card Management">
  <data key="d0">SIM Card Management</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">SIM Card Management allows users to manage network settings for multiple SIM cards effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;SIM Card Management is a feature within the Nothing Phone that allows users to manage dual SIM functionalities for network and call preferences.&lt;SEP&gt;SIM Card Management refers to the functionality that allows users to switch between SIM cards or set preferences for calls and messages.&lt;SEP&gt;SIM Card Management refers to the functionality within Nothing Phone (2) to manage dual SIM settings for network and call preferences.</data>
