<node id="USB OTG">
  <data key="d0">USB OTG</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">USB OTG (On The Go) is a standard that allows mobile devices, including the Nothing Phone (2), to connect and communicate directly with each other without the need for a PC. This feature enhances connectivity options by enabling various functionalities, such as reading data from USB devices and facilitating direct communication between mobile devices. By utilizing USB OTG, devices can effectively communicate and transfer data, improving the overall user experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e55e3fed26fabdb52106695b9582ce3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9025d462a4f9ed5f5840d5850b11449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77d37b7781a21f9ace596c3bcb0cbfd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0028e301a1da668320afc0e2e78601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7b5b1eb951ce536bdbb599b623332a</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612265</data>
</node>
<node id="Data Roaming">
  <data key="d0">Data Roaming</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Data Roaming is a service that enables users to access their mobile data services while outside of their home network region. This capability allows individuals to utilize data services on foreign networks; however, it often comes with additional charges. The use of data roaming typically incurs higher fees due to the nature of network access outside the user's home area. Specifically, on devices such as the Nothing Phone (2a), users can access data services through data roaming while connected to a foreign network, though it requires specific settings to be configured. Overall, data roaming facilitates mobile connectivity when traveling, but users should be aware of the potential increased costs associated with this service.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-e55e3fed26fabdb52106695b9582ce3b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcde7317fc7b036415d89ea81329b232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77d37b7781a21f9ace596c3bcb0cbfd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0028e301a1da668320afc0e2e78601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7b5b1eb951ce536bdbb599b623332a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9ff89b42c8123f60ebe4521bfb0cbd</data>
