<node id="Network Connection Failures">
  <data key="d0">Network Connection Failures</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Network Connection Failures refer to issues that prevent calls or data use on a phone, often due to congestion or SIM card problems.&lt;SEP&gt;Network connection failures during a call can result from various factors, including congestion and SIM card issues.&lt;SEP&gt;Network connection failures refer to issues during a call that may arise due to congestion or SIM card problems.</data>
