<node id="Status Bar">
  <data key="d0">Status Bar</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Status Bar is a user interface element on the Nothing Phone that displays essential information like time and battery status.&lt;SEP&gt;The Status Bar is an interface element on a smartphone that displays important indicators such as time, battery life, and notifications.&lt;SEP&gt;The status bar is an interface component on a phone screen displaying important information such as notifications, battery life, and connectivity status.</data>
