<node id="GPS Function">
  <data key="d0">GPS Function</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">GPS Function is a capability of the Watch Pro 2 that allows users to track their location and activity accurately.&lt;SEP&gt;The GPS Function allows the Watch Pro 2 to track outdoor workouts accurately by using a built-in GPS chip.&lt;SEP&gt;The GPS function in the Nothing Phone is activated during outdoor exercise modes, enabling accurate tracking of workouts.</data>
