<node id="WiFi Direct">
  <data key="d0">WiFi Direct</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">WiFi Direct is a technology that allows devices to connect directly over WiFi, facilitating fast file sharing and screen casting without the need for a traditional network or wired connections. This feature enhances the user experience by providing advantages over Bluetooth, particularly in terms of speed and range. WiFi Direct enables devices to establish a direct wireless connection, allowing for efficient sharing of files and real-time screen sharing, thereby broadening the capabilities typically associated with standard Bluetooth connections. Notably, it allows devices, including smartphones like the Phone (2a), to connect seamlessly for these purposes.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-f9ceda8e99b5757b3aaecad74209f71d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bd5bdbf50fdf619063eece8e9e67241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3060d71588cf955b2b239dbba0bd791d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77d37b7781a21f9ace596c3bcb0cbfd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7b5b1eb951ce536bdbb599b623332a</data>
