  <data key="d0">Charging Protocols</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Charging Protocols are industry standards for the fast charging capabilities of devices.&lt;SEP&gt;Charging protocols determine the compatibility and speed of charging the Nothing Phone, with recommendations to use a PPS protocol charger for optimal performance.</data>
