  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The User Manual is a document that provides instructions on how to use a device safely and effectively, including troubleshooting tips.&lt;SEP&gt;The User Manual provides instructions on how to properly use and troubleshoot the adaptor, including power parameters and safety measures.&lt;SEP&gt;The user manual provides guidance on the functionalities and best practices for operating Phone 1, including updates and troubleshooting.</data>
