  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Expandable Storage refers to additional memory options, which are not available on Phone (2a), limiting storage capacity.&lt;SEP&gt;Expandable storage refers to the ability to increase the storage capacity of Phone 1 via a MicroSD card.</data>
