<node id="Fingerprint Unlock">
  <data key="d0">Fingerprint Unlock</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Fingerprint Unlock is a biometric security feature implemented across multiple devices, including the Nothing Phone (1) and another device referred to as Phone (2a). This feature allows users to unlock their devices by utilizing their unique fingerprints, providing a convenient and secure method of user authentication. Specifically, on the Nothing Phone, Fingerprint Unlock enables seamless access through fingerprint recognition, enhancing security while streamlining the unlocking process. Overall, Fingerprint Unlock serves as a crucial security method for users wanting to protect their devices through personalized biometric data.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c9025d462a4f9ed5f5840d5850b11449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bd5bdbf50fdf619063eece8e9e67241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0028e301a1da668320afc0e2e78601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7b5b1eb951ce536bdbb599b623332a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9ff89b42c8123f60ebe4521bfb0cbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a</data>
