<node id="Face Unlock">
  <data key="d0">Face Unlock</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Face Unlock is a biometric authentication feature available on the Nothing Phone (1) that employs facial recognition technology to enable users to unlock their device. This security feature allows for user authentication through facial recognition, ensuring a convenient and secure way to access the phone. Face Unlock also extends its functionality to other devices, such as Phone (2a), utilizing similar facial recognition capabilities for unlocking. Overall, Face Unlock serves as an advanced biometric security option for users looking to enhance their device’s security through modern technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-c9025d462a4f9ed5f5840d5850b11449&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bd5bdbf50fdf619063eece8e9e67241&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0028e301a1da668320afc0e2e78601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7b5b1eb951ce536bdbb599b623332a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9ff89b42c8123f60ebe4521bfb0cbd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a</data>
