  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Bluetooth Connectivity is essential for pairing the CMF Watch Pro 2 with smartphones to facilitate various functions including notifications and camera control.&lt;SEP&gt;Bluetooth Connectivity refers to the capability of Ear (2) to connect to multiple devices wirelessly, allowing seamless switching between them.</data>
