  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Health Monitoring Features are capabilities of the Watch Pro 2 that include tracking heart rate, blood oxygen, sleep detection, and physical activity.&lt;SEP&gt;Health Monitoring Features include various functions such as heart rate monitoring, sleep tracking, and activity logging available on the CMF Watch Pro 2.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2666978485c7758b69e3c834ba80fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6d88ccae3cdc762688c1e8d90c4e68c4</data>
