<node id="CMF Watch App">
  <data key="d0">CMF Watch App</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">The CMF Watch App is a comprehensive mobile application specifically designed to interface with the CMF Watch Pro device. This app enables users to manage various settings, perform firmware upgrades, and synchronize health data with models like the Watch Pro 2. Through the CMF Watch App, users can access enhanced features for tracking health metrics, customize settings, download watch faces, and monitor workout activities. Additionally, the application facilitates the management of notifications and call functions. Overall, the CMF Watch App serves as a vital tool for optimizing the use and functionality of the CMF Watch Pro device.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-852b3a0efad903b6a432ebd5e7a404af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2666978485c7758b69e3c834ba80fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612291</data>
</node>
<node id="Active Score">
  <data key="d0">Active Score</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Active Score is a health metric that quantifies physical activity based on heart rate data, providing insight into workout intensity over a rolling 7-day period.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-2666978485c7758b69e3c834ba80fefe</data>
