  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Heart Rate Measurement is an essential function of the Watch Pro that monitors the user's heart rate, dependent on correct usage and positioning of the watch.&lt;SEP&gt;Heart Rate Measurement refers to the tracking of heart rate in various states, such as resting, exercise, and average rates during different activities.&lt;SEP&gt;Heart rate measurement is a function of the Watch Pro that tracks the user's heart rate during various activities.</data>
