  <data key="d2">Brightness Adjustment allows users to modify the brightness level of the Glyph Interface for better visibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Brightness Adjustment is a feature in the Watch Pro 2 that automatically adjusts screen brightness based on ambient light conditions.</data>
