<node id="Voice Assistant">
  <data key="d0">Voice Assistant</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Voice Assistant is a multifunctional feature available on both the Nothing Ear (a) and the Watch Pro 2, designed to facilitate hands-free interaction with mobile devices. For the Nothing Ear products, including the Ear (a) and Ear (open), users can activate the Voice Assistant through the Nothing X app, which enables them to use voice commands for various functions. This hands-free control enhances user convenience while engaged with their devices. Similarly, the Watch Pro 2 incorporates the Voice Assistant as an integrated tool, allowing users to perform tasks using voice commands, thereby ensuring a seamless and efficient user experience. To utilize these voice control functionalities, specific settings must be configured in the Nothing X app, making it essential for users to familiarize themselves with the setup process for optimal use of the Voice Assistant across both devices.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-6e908dc520371478d52528beaf43780b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dbdc3aa884ec77acb84402d00879691d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128e66067604ae44825d98ba3ed45122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92e27c35cbd2d81e7710bdeb957abdb9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2666978485c7758b69e3c834ba80fefe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-26891fa7fbcc5e292dab7ce65ee89518</data>
  <data key="d4">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d5">1767612300</data>
</node>
<node id="Step Count">
  <data key="d0">Step Count</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Step Count is a health metric that tracks the number of steps taken by the user throughout the day, promoting physical activity.</data>
