<node id="Alarm">
  <data key="d0">Alarm</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">The Alarm is a versatile tool available on devices such as the Watch Pro 2 and mobile devices, enabling users to set reminders and alerts for specific times. This function serves various purposes, including wake-up calls and scheduling notifications, making it a valuable feature for time management. Users can customize alarms with options for sound, vibration, and repeat settings to suit their preferences. Overall, the Alarm feature is designed to help individuals effectively manage their schedules by providing timely reminders and alerts tailored to their needs.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-8238a048f616eaf02f92d0455ae0f39b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8cd614c63bd30923f007ff94a3e7a5d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-128e66067604ae44825d98ba3ed45122&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-36249177cb5d5f7c720a6f64a0edc813&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c14c96115117369f38094721a77a31ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-34426e6693364728fe244fbfe87a0629</data>
