<node id="Dual SIM">
  <data key="d0">Dual SIM</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">Dual SIM is a feature found in the Nothing Phone and specifically in Phone (2a), which enables the device to support two SIM cards simultaneously. This capability provides users with enhanced connectivity options, allowing them to manage both personal and work phone numbers from a single device. Dual SIM technology facilitates the operation of two different phone numbers concurrently, thereby offering users flexibility in their communication needs. By allowing the use of two SIM cards within one smartphone, the Dual SIM feature caters to individuals who wish to maintain separate personal and professional phone lines, enhancing their overall mobile experience.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3060d71588cf955b2b239dbba0bd791d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fcde7317fc7b036415d89ea81329b232&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a0028e301a1da668320afc0e2e78601b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7b5b1eb951ce536bdbb599b623332a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9ff89b42c8123f60ebe4521bfb0cbd</data>
