<node id="USB Tethering">
  <data key="d0">USB Tethering</data>
  <data key="d1">category</data>
  <data key="d2">USB Tethering is a feature that enables a smartphone, specifically the Nothing Phone (2a), to share its internet connection with other devices through USB cable configurations. This functionality allows the Nothing Phone to connect to a PC or other devices, effectively transforming it into a WiFi router. By using USB tethering, users can share their mobile internet connection seamlessly with various devices, making it a convenient option for internet access. Overall, USB tethering provides an efficient means of sharing connectivity, particularly with the Nothing Phone (2a).</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-3060d71588cf955b2b239dbba0bd791d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e8ab8b542ad8bdfa536d2314963d9701&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-77d37b7781a21f9ace596c3bcb0cbfd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-258395120725348800696992422fd798&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8b7b5b1eb951ce536bdbb599b623332a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d9ff89b42c8123f60ebe4521bfb0cbd</data>
