<node id="Google">
  <data key="d0">Google</data>
  <data key="d1">organization</data>
  <data key="d2">Google is a multinational technology company renowned for its comprehensive range of Internet-related services and products. It specializes in areas such as online advertising, search engines, software development, and hardware production. Among its significant offerings are the Google Play Store, which allows users to download apps, and the Google Assistant, which aids users in operating devices, including the Nothing Phone. Additionally, Google provides several integrated services for the Nothing Phone, such as location services, device backup, and Find My Phone functionalities. With its diverse portfolio, Google continues to be a leading player in the tech industry, influencing how individuals and businesses interact with technology.</data>
  <data key="d3">chunk-ff9ab0e6b0a19cc3df9b2e42e60f607f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3a9fb365d0322c82fb6ff52dc4a7925f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d52fb5275de8c3b54cbe38e612348505&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d866982ab2e7ced6661f8a940789dee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-748aef9e02744a06105085d3fb0c0fd0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8d629090523155bf0dd12f9021e8a28a</data>
