<edge source="CMF Watch app" target="Watch Pro">
  <data key="d6">98.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CMF Watch app is an essential companion for the Watch Pro, significantly enhancing its functionality and features to provide users with a more comprehensive tracking experience. This app enables music control, customization options, and health monitoring, thus maximizing the capabilities of the Watch Pro. 

The CMF Watch app serves multiple critical roles, including upgrading and managing the settings of the Watch Pro, ensuring its optimal performance. It is required for synchronization of workout data and facilitates the access to features such as weather updates and custom exercise types. The app and the Watch Pro work in conjunction, with the former playing a vital role in firmware upgrades, configuration, and overall management of functionalities. 

In summary, the Watch Pro relies heavily on the CMF Watch app for connectivity, feature access, and updates, creating a synergistic relationship that enhances the user experience.</data>
  <data key="d8">app integration,app support,application dependency,application usage,connectivity,device application,device functionality,device management,enhanced functionality,functionality support,smartwatch functionality,software,software integration,synchronization</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-2813ffd84d05996e288b7ae91da38439&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a6dc70b538423eed2a153e23decae4c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-118d2f64ec32e517a13b31894b48b9ad&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1f73d28d893bcd51ecb5c4b3b1f54870&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a20228c525a0011e08b219ab5989855a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8dbac70984f20a7113387507b57809f2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fde4d61094019d5f75532f5f5f817f6a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b31736155d9fcbf91049d0a9e73805dc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bf93869f27e0db181fc1e8abda02b165&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c923c17927fa4e291cc287467061e0cf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300</data>
  <data key="d10">unknown_source</data>
  <data key="d11">1767612366</data>
</edge>
