<edge source="Watch Pro" target="CMF Watch App">
  <data key="d6">54.0</data>
  <data key="d7">The CMF Watch App is an essential companion for the Watch Pro, designed to enhance its functionality and provide users with a range of features. Through the CMF Watch App, users can manage device settings and updates, facilitating improvements in the device's performance. The app allows the Watch Pro to access important functionalities, such as weather updates and custom exercise types. Furthermore, the Watch Pro depends on the CMF Watch App for configuration settings, firmware updates, and overall enhancements, establishing a crucial connection between the hardware and software of the device. Together, the CMF Watch App and Watch Pro create an integrated user experience that maximizes their capabilities.</data>
  <data key="d8">app functionality,app integration,application functionality,application support,device integration,device management,software application,synchronization</data>
  <data key="d9">chunk-852b3a0efad903b6a432ebd5e7a404af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ea57d11556bf408a29dc7c7e37398cc2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1937bef2f48d7dfa41b98235ae13df22&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fec2c3e80ab69404ff0b23b014c07483&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a1887c3e753e5f27cc1105a32465893f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-76cdae3356bcf4004a71c8e11a80f300</data>
