  <data key="d7">Find My Phone requires a Google Account to function properly, linking the device's location and management services.&lt;SEP&gt;Find My Phone requires a Google Account to function, allowing users to locate their devices through Google services.&lt;SEP&gt;The 'Find My Phone' feature requires a Google Account to function, allowing tracking and management of a lost device.&lt;SEP&gt;To use the Find My Phone service, a user must sign in with their Google Account.</data>
